WEBVTT

00:03.030 --> 00:04.910
Sweet goodness!

00:05.230 --> 00:09.020
Sugary treats make the best 
breaks from studying.

00:09.020 --> 00:12.460
I hope you enjoy my Dionaea mille-feuille.

00:13.940 --> 00:15.570
It's sweet and delicious!

00:15.570 --> 00:18.330
I never knew you were so 
good at making desserts.

00:18.330 --> 00:24.420
I lack magical power, but at the very least, 
I've been able to perfect my favorite treats.

00:24.670 --> 00:29.750
When I bake with love, 
even I can make people smile.

00:29.750 --> 00:31.290
It makes me so glad.

00:31.290 --> 00:32.510
Really?

00:33.030 --> 00:35.640
Then these pastries must be your magic.

00:36.850 --> 00:39.480
That's why they're so good.

00:39.480 --> 00:44.560
My! And your words are like 
magic to me, Lady Sariphi!

00:45.460 --> 00:48.400
Would you teach me to bake today?

00:48.400 --> 00:50.310
But of course!

00:50.310 --> 00:53.470
Is there a gentleman for whom 
you'd like to make a treat?

00:58.320 --> 01:01.250
Oh, Lady Sariphi! You're simply charming!

01:01.250 --> 01:03.050
I could just gobble you up!

01:03.920 --> 01:05.090
Munch, munch!

01:05.090 --> 01:06.870
Munch, munch, munch!

01:05.900 --> 01:07.190
Something smells pleasant.

01:08.950 --> 01:11.130
Captain Jormungand!

01:11.630 --> 01:15.760
C-Captain Jormungand! U-Um...

01:16.490 --> 01:18.610
Would you care for one?

01:18.970 --> 01:20.790
Why, Princess Amit.

01:20.790 --> 01:23.670
While I am honored, I must train soon.

01:24.490 --> 01:28.990
Human lady, I have business with you.

03:00.950 --> 03:05.950
The Holy Beast of Immortality and Rebirth

03:06.350 --> 03:08.160
A royal council?

03:08.160 --> 03:13.670
Yes. The king and his chief vassals 
have convened in the council chamber.

03:14.190 --> 03:19.090
Chancellor Anubis requested 
that I escort you to join them.

03:20.060 --> 03:22.410
<i>The chancellor asked for me?</i>

03:22.410 --> 03:23.520
About Abi...

03:24.410 --> 03:26.880
I know he has a sharp tongue.

03:27.350 --> 03:30.110
I can't blame you for resenting him.

03:30.600 --> 03:34.600
But all he does, he does to defend the king.

03:35.260 --> 03:40.020
The line of Anubis has existed to serve 
the royal family for generations.

03:40.560 --> 03:45.470
He would do anything to 
protect the king's throne.

03:46.170 --> 03:51.030
Even if that meant defying the king's will.

03:51.500 --> 03:56.180
I wish to receive the Lady 
Sariphi as our formal queen.

03:56.590 --> 04:00.010
What are you playing at, Anubis?

04:00.010 --> 04:04.510
Sire, I merely considered your 
strong feelings on this matter.

04:04.850 --> 04:08.590
However, I do wish to impose 
certain conditions.

04:09.390 --> 04:10.520
What?

04:10.520 --> 04:15.930
I realize that we should not presume 
to test our future queen.

04:15.930 --> 04:16.910
That said,

04:17.180 --> 04:22.670
to present the people with a human, 
a former sacrifice of no noble rank,

04:22.670 --> 04:25.660
would sow disorder in the realm.

04:25.920 --> 04:31.530
Lady Sariphi must make herself the most 
accomplished consort in our history.

04:31.970 --> 04:35.330
Hence the conditions I propose.

04:35.750 --> 04:38.290
The first of these

04:38.540 --> 04:44.260
is that Lady Sariphi must learn 
to command a holy beast.

04:45.690 --> 04:52.360
Queens traditionally forge a pact 
with a holy beast when they marry.

04:52.730 --> 04:58.300
Commanding one of these divine messengers 
is a symbol of royal authority.

04:59.250 --> 05:04.060
But Sariphi has no magical power. 
If she were to do such a thing,

05:04.620 --> 05:07.850
it would consume her life instead.

05:08.250 --> 05:11.460
You must know that.

05:11.820 --> 05:13.780
And that isn't all.

05:14.500 --> 05:19.360
If she mistakenly summons a wicked demon,

05:19.360 --> 05:23.550
then it will claim her, 
since she lacks the power to resist,

05:23.890 --> 05:29.160
and she'll wander hell for eternity, 
unable even to die.

05:31.710 --> 05:35.300
For that reason, we will 
not force the issue.

05:35.580 --> 05:38.420
Lady Sariphi is free to decide.

05:38.420 --> 05:40.770
Will you accept these trials or not?

05:40.770 --> 05:43.220
The choice is yours.

05:45.320 --> 05:46.620
Out of the question!

05:46.620 --> 05:50.490
I need not entertain such base proposals.

05:50.880 --> 05:53.400
My queen is mine to choose!

05:54.300 --> 05:55.310
Your Majesty.

05:55.310 --> 05:57.580
Strike today's council from your memory.

05:58.050 --> 06:01.370
I swear that I'll make them accept you.

06:01.370 --> 06:03.310
I'll let no one stand between us.

06:05.660 --> 06:06.750
But...

06:07.070 --> 06:09.300
...would sow disorder in the realm.

06:09.300 --> 06:12.720
But all he does, he does to defend the king.

06:14.340 --> 06:16.930
Don't dwell on matters 
that don't concern you.

06:17.630 --> 06:20.220
I will keep you safe.

06:24.240 --> 06:26.400
Don't worry, Sariphi!

06:26.400 --> 06:30.770
You don't need to endanger yourself! 
His Majesty will sort it out!

06:30.770 --> 06:33.190
And we'll protect you, too!

06:33.190 --> 06:34.160
Protect!

06:34.160 --> 06:35.760
Thank you.

06:35.760 --> 06:39.000
Why are the two of you so good to me?

06:39.000 --> 06:41.990
His Majesty rescued us.

06:42.370 --> 06:45.140
We're the runts of the Cyclopian Clan.

06:45.140 --> 06:47.560
It takes two of us to do one beast's job.

06:47.560 --> 06:52.510
But the king gave us honest work 
doing odd jobs around the palace.

06:52.820 --> 06:56.860
What matters to His Majesty 
matters to us, too!

06:57.270 --> 06:58.670
Besides...

06:59.700 --> 07:05.730
You're nice to us, Sari, 
so we c-care about you!

07:06.040 --> 07:07.460
Care about Sari!

07:11.380 --> 07:15.450
Don't relax just because this is 
training! Watch your opponent!

07:15.450 --> 07:18.760
Wild sword strokes will 
never strike the foe!

07:18.760 --> 07:23.340
<i>Everyone is choosing to do their parts.</i>

07:23.750 --> 07:26.890
<i>They all care about the king 
in their own ways.</i>

07:28.090 --> 07:29.120
<i>So...</i>

07:30.010 --> 07:31.530
<i>So what do I do?</i>

07:32.610 --> 07:38.400
<i>His Majesty might get in trouble 
and lose a lot because of me.</i>

07:42.320 --> 07:45.120
<i>That makes me the only one being protected.</i>

07:46.030 --> 07:47.420
<i>The only one.</i>

07:48.870 --> 07:51.070
This girl is the latest offering.

07:51.980 --> 07:55.170
The 99th sacrifice.

07:55.480 --> 07:57.390
I've eaten you.

07:57.790 --> 08:00.620
Now you belong to me.

08:00.990 --> 08:03.530
<i>I need to be more prepared, too.</i>

08:03.790 --> 08:07.240
<i>For what it means to stay 
by the king's side.</i>

08:13.140 --> 08:17.380
I hereby witness that you have 
sealed this pledge in blood.

08:18.600 --> 08:22.230
Sariphi! What is the meaning of this?!

08:22.880 --> 08:24.610
I'm sorry, Your Majesty.

08:24.930 --> 08:27.320
But I've made up my mind.

08:27.860 --> 08:32.790
I've been doing my best to think 
of ways I can help you,

08:32.790 --> 08:34.360
and I've finally found one.

08:34.740 --> 08:37.340
This is the right thing for me to do now.

08:38.150 --> 08:42.300
<i>I need to win everyone's acceptance.</i>

08:42.920 --> 08:45.320
<i>That will protect the king.</i>

08:46.500 --> 08:47.480
<i>So...</i>

08:48.940 --> 08:52.890
I offer you my life.

08:55.040 --> 08:58.600
She'll give her life force in place of magic?

08:58.910 --> 09:03.150
W-Will that really be safe for Lady Sariphi?

09:03.150 --> 09:05.030
That's not the only risk.

09:05.030 --> 09:08.910
If she slips up and summons a wicked demon,

09:08.910 --> 09:11.950
it'll possess her, and awful things will happen.

09:11.950 --> 09:13.190
Awful!

09:19.580 --> 09:25.440
Utogalia, utogalia, telek, 
tekitelemau, uyuriti,

09:25.870 --> 09:29.040
niyono, kogashtawa, izansono,

09:30.050 --> 09:32.470
tanagaleso, itoutla...

09:32.470 --> 09:35.650
<i>All my strength is... draining away.</i>

09:33.720 --> 09:36.930
...kadata, nahwatanar.

09:42.150 --> 09:43.940
Lady Sariphi!

09:43.940 --> 09:45.910
Wh-What just happened?

09:45.910 --> 09:48.920
She stopped before finishing the incantation.

09:48.920 --> 09:52.730
When the spell fails, 
it rebounds on the caster.

09:54.540 --> 09:57.710
<i>So this is what happens when I mess up.</i>

09:58.680 --> 10:00.960
<i>I feel so exhausted,</i>

10:00.960 --> 10:03.870
<i>like I really did have 
the life sucked out of me.</i>

10:05.360 --> 10:08.600
<i>But this is no time to lose heart.</i>

10:09.160 --> 10:11.050
<i>I've only just started.</i>

10:11.470 --> 10:12.530
<i>I'll do it this time.</i>

10:13.000 --> 10:16.410
Telek, tekitelemau, uyuriti...

10:17.230 --> 10:18.540
Sariphi!

10:20.860 --> 10:22.550
<i>I can't move.</i>

10:23.260 --> 10:27.220
<i>Maybe the king was right, 
and I really can't do this.</i>

10:28.190 --> 10:30.560
<i>You can't complete that trial.</i>

10:31.350 --> 10:34.570
I swore that I would make you my queen.

10:34.950 --> 10:37.970
Why did you do this without consulting me?!

10:37.970 --> 10:42.030
I'm sorry, but I'm the only one 
who you just protect.

10:42.470 --> 10:44.630
I'm the only one who can't do anything,

10:44.630 --> 10:46.080
and I'm sick of it.

10:47.150 --> 10:48.670
<i>I made up my mind</i>

10:50.200 --> 10:54.010
<i>that I'd do whatever I could, too.</i>

10:55.170 --> 10:56.590
Lady Sariphi...

10:56.980 --> 11:01.680
Should she really be doing this 
after she collapsed yesterday?

11:02.980 --> 11:08.100
A human can't perform the rite of 
summoning more than twice a day.

11:08.390 --> 11:11.470
If she keeps failing, she'll be in danger.

11:12.300 --> 11:14.390
<i>I drew the magic circle right.</i>

11:15.170 --> 11:18.790
<i>Now I just need to be careful 
with the incantation.</i>

11:19.160 --> 11:23.660
Utogalia, utogalia, telek, 
tekitelemau, uyuriti...

11:27.200 --> 11:28.230
Sari!

11:30.490 --> 11:36.080
If you wish to visit the human lady, 
I cannot let you pass.

11:36.340 --> 11:40.970
B-But I truly fear for Lady Sariphi's safety!

11:40.970 --> 11:42.880
If she has accepted the risks,

11:43.430 --> 11:46.600
then those who watch over her must, as well.

11:49.980 --> 11:51.610
Lady Sariphi...

11:52.900 --> 11:54.910
<i>I have to keep trying.</i>

11:56.050 --> 11:57.560
<i>I've accepted the risks.</i>

11:58.100 --> 12:01.880
<i>No matter how reckless this is 
or how it turns out,</i>

12:03.710 --> 12:07.410
<i>I won't let that stop me!</i>

12:04.910 --> 12:08.280
Niyono, kogashtawa, izansono, tanagaleso...

12:09.480 --> 12:10.700
Sari!

12:17.060 --> 12:18.340
<i>Sire?</i>

12:19.460 --> 12:21.590
What are you doing, sire?

12:22.080 --> 12:28.440
The pledge states that she will not 
seek aid under any circumstances.

12:28.440 --> 12:32.560
And even you, sire, are no exception.

12:32.560 --> 12:36.170
I'm not aiding her. I'm merely 
granting her a brief rest.

12:36.170 --> 12:37.190
Unacceptable.

12:37.430 --> 12:40.220
If you insist on such tortured logic,

12:40.220 --> 12:43.350
I must consider that she has 
abandoned this trial and...

12:46.770 --> 12:52.450
I have not broken the terms, 
so I will not have my actions questioned.

12:52.720 --> 12:54.690
Today's attempt is at an end.

12:57.690 --> 12:59.260
Wait, sire.

13:00.080 --> 13:02.180
I'm fine.

13:02.810 --> 13:05.310
You've done all you can.

13:05.310 --> 13:09.600
If you continue, you truly will die.

13:10.430 --> 13:15.800
My life was always meant to be sacrificed.

13:16.220 --> 13:19.410
I'm not the least bit scared of dying.

13:20.530 --> 13:21.650
Fool!

13:22.690 --> 13:23.900
Do not forget.

13:24.520 --> 13:27.480
Your life was offered up to me.

13:29.240 --> 13:31.070
It is my property.

13:31.620 --> 13:35.160
Don't make me lose you!

13:42.350 --> 13:43.550
<i>Sire...</i>

13:47.380 --> 13:49.460
Why, Lady Sariphi.

13:49.460 --> 13:55.450
I didn't see you for a whole day, 
so I assumed you had fled from...

14:02.270 --> 14:06.480
<i>What have I been doing all this time?</i>

14:07.720 --> 14:12.610
Utogalia, utogalia, telek, 
tekitelemau, uyuriti,

14:12.850 --> 14:15.940
niyono, kogashtawa, izansono...

14:19.130 --> 14:21.830
Could this be... success?!

14:21.830 --> 14:24.040
She hadn't finished the incantation!

14:24.440 --> 14:27.810
But it's clearly different 
from her previous failures.

14:28.230 --> 14:33.520
<i>She and her garments aren't burning. 
These fell flames consume her within.</i>

14:34.020 --> 14:38.470
<i>Has the wench summoned 
a wicked demon at last?!</i>

14:38.850 --> 14:43.010
<i>When I gave up my life for the king,</i>

14:44.310 --> 14:48.870
<i>did I want to make him look 
like that from now on?</i>

14:50.330 --> 14:51.720
<i>No.</i>

14:57.210 --> 15:02.040
...tanagaleso, itoutla, kadata, nahwatanar!

15:02.370 --> 15:03.550
<i>What?!</i>

15:04.990 --> 15:06.090
<i>Yes!</i>

15:06.440 --> 15:10.160
<i>A holy beast bonds with its master's soul.</i>

15:10.830 --> 15:14.740
<i>Those whose hearts are wicked or weak</i>

15:15.080 --> 15:18.150
<i>and those who deny the future 
cannot behold them.</i>

15:18.650 --> 15:19.600
<i>Have hope!</i>

15:20.260 --> 15:24.950
<i>I need to live! With His Majesty—with Leo!</i>

15:34.420 --> 15:36.750
C-Could this be...

15:39.770 --> 15:41.240
<i>...a holy beast?</i>

15:42.880 --> 15:45.420
<i>It's smaller than I expected.</i>

15:50.710 --> 15:53.050
Well done, Sariphi.

15:53.870 --> 15:54.720
Thanks.

15:59.130 --> 16:02.780
What're you staring at me for? 
You wanna throw down?

16:02.780 --> 16:05.860
I'll beat your stupid, 
ugly mugs black and blue.

16:05.860 --> 16:08.300
I can't make out a word you're saying.

16:08.910 --> 16:12.500
This meal was supposed to help 
get Sari's strength back!

16:12.500 --> 16:13.990
No eat!

16:13.990 --> 16:16.940
It's all right, Cy, Clops.

16:16.940 --> 16:19.800
He came all the way here for me.

16:20.400 --> 16:22.010
<i>Although...</i>

16:22.010 --> 16:26.510
You think this cheap grub is good 
enough for <i>me</i>, lunkheads?

16:26.860 --> 16:28.500
<i>...he's awfully rude.</i>

16:28.720 --> 16:32.380
I ain't just any holy beast.

16:33.460 --> 16:38.010
Only <i>I</i> have the powers 
of immortality and rebirth.

16:38.010 --> 16:41.630
You can call me Bennu the Great, 
the one and only phoenix.

16:42.280 --> 16:43.950
<i>Phoenix?</i>

16:43.950 --> 16:46.320
I may not be much to look at now,

16:46.320 --> 16:50.200
but I was once a sacred bird 
with gold and scarlet plumage.

16:50.470 --> 16:55.490
People called me the most beautiful 
and sublime holy beast out there.

16:55.490 --> 16:58.150
Wow, Mr. Phoenix! That's amazing!

16:59.170 --> 17:04.540
You bet. A big shot like me is wasted 
on a little human girlie like you.

17:04.740 --> 17:07.950
Now that you know, show me some 
reverence, you brainless dolt.

17:08.600 --> 17:10.530
<i>That</i> is the fabled phoenix?

17:10.820 --> 17:12.300
Lord Anubis!

17:12.300 --> 17:17.170
I beg your pardon, Lady Sariphi, 
but that scrawny, vulgar creature

17:17.170 --> 17:19.210
Hey! Watch it!

17:17.170 --> 17:21.220
can hardly be the phoenix, 
a divine messenger.

17:19.210 --> 17:21.700
Who're you calling a 
"scrawny, vulgar creature"?!

17:21.220 --> 17:23.940
But that's what he says he is.

17:21.700 --> 17:23.940
Say that again! I dare you!

17:23.940 --> 17:26.310
Hey, dog-breath! You making fun of me?!

17:26.560 --> 17:30.690
I'm the phoenix! I've lived a 
hundred times longer than you!

17:30.690 --> 17:33.170
I'll knock your block off, jackass!

17:30.690 --> 17:34.560
Lady Sariphi, can you understand 
what the holy beast is saying?

17:33.170 --> 17:36.330
Don't look down your nose 
at me from way up there!

17:34.560 --> 17:37.460
Yup. He's been talking this whole time.

17:36.330 --> 17:37.900
I want grub!

17:39.310 --> 17:44.340
Admittedly, holy beasts can be 
understood only by their summoners,

17:44.340 --> 17:47.450
but my issue is not with 
the truth of the matter.

17:47.690 --> 17:53.780
I want to know if the people will accept... 
<i>that</i> as the holy beast of their queen.

17:54.080 --> 17:57.830
That beast could not possibly 
appear less phoenix-like.

17:57.830 --> 18:04.420
It won't do, unless by some miracle 
it were to assume a more regal form.

18:05.340 --> 18:07.530
But that hardly seems likely.

18:07.970 --> 18:11.690
That sorry excuse for a bird can't even fly.

18:14.540 --> 18:18.320
Chancellor! Was it wise to say that? 
If by some chance...

18:18.320 --> 18:20.280
Have no fear.

18:20.490 --> 18:24.950
That holy beast appears to have long 
since exhausted its sacred power.

18:24.950 --> 18:26.780
It is but a shell of its former self.

18:26.780 --> 18:29.040
B-But even so...

18:29.370 --> 18:35.830
If you are so concerned, why not devise 
a plan of your own on occasion?

18:37.250 --> 18:38.800
Okay, Mr. Phoenix,

18:39.340 --> 18:41.270
follow my lead.

18:41.560 --> 18:45.490
What's that fancy getup for, girlie?

18:45.830 --> 18:48.230
I just made it in a hurry.

18:48.730 --> 18:53.020
Baby birds learn to fly by 
watching their parents, right?

18:53.020 --> 18:55.480
Who're you calling a baby?!

18:55.480 --> 18:58.070
All right, watch closely!

18:58.070 --> 18:59.740
Hold it, featherbrain!

19:02.890 --> 19:05.340
N-Now you try.

19:05.340 --> 19:07.370
Like hell I will!

19:07.570 --> 19:11.000
Okay, I'll fan you, so ride the breeze!

19:11.000 --> 19:13.960
I'm just getting blown around, you moron!

19:16.170 --> 19:18.720
I hope Lady Sariphi will be all right.

19:19.080 --> 19:22.430
She's hasn't even fully recovered yet.

19:24.880 --> 19:26.780
Time out! I quit!

19:27.130 --> 19:28.660
Mr. Phoenix...

19:28.660 --> 19:31.270
I'm fed up with this crap!

19:31.270 --> 19:32.850
I know better than anybody.

19:33.510 --> 19:38.770
I used up all my power. 
I'm just a chicken carcass now.

19:40.290 --> 19:42.800
Is that it for your power of rebirth?!

19:42.800 --> 19:45.870
The battlefield's still littered 
with wounded soldiers!

19:45.870 --> 19:47.450
Shield me!

19:47.450 --> 19:49.640
You're immortal, right?!

19:50.250 --> 19:52.950
I'll never be able to fly again.

19:53.490 --> 19:56.960
But so what?! Being grounded won't kill me!

19:58.280 --> 20:00.130
I'm sorry, Mr. Phoenix.

20:01.620 --> 20:03.630
I shouldn't have pushed you.

20:04.260 --> 20:09.800
I thought that, in truth, you wanted 
to fly more than anyone else.

20:10.390 --> 20:13.890
But please don't put yourself 
down as you are now.

20:14.780 --> 20:15.980
I had nothing,

20:17.000 --> 20:19.980
but still, you came to me.

20:20.340 --> 20:21.840
Well done.

20:21.840 --> 20:24.620
You gave me so much confidence.

20:25.490 --> 20:29.780
Even if you're a bit small,
even if you can't fly,

20:29.780 --> 20:33.920
to me, you're a magnificent holy beast.

20:36.150 --> 20:39.980
Mr. Phoenix, it's breakfast time!

20:41.260 --> 20:42.330
<i>Is that...</i>

20:48.860 --> 20:50.610
<i>Mr. Phoenix?</i>

20:52.840 --> 20:56.560
C-Can we really get away with this, boss?

20:56.560 --> 20:59.420
Sneaking into the royal palace and...

20:59.420 --> 21:01.380
Just shut up and keep watch!

21:01.380 --> 21:04.900
Killing this one lousy bird pays enough 
for us to live on for half a year.

21:05.240 --> 21:07.700
Easiest money I ever heard of.

21:09.630 --> 21:11.640
<i>Why the hell am I doing this?</i>

21:12.320 --> 21:14.660
<i>Who cares if I can't fly?</i>

21:15.440 --> 21:17.790
<i>Who needs to look good?</i>

21:18.350 --> 21:21.540
<i>This way, no one'll overwork me.</i>

21:22.110 --> 21:26.220
<i>No one'll need me anymore.</i>

21:26.900 --> 21:30.950
{i\1}This{i\0} is the phoenix? What a joke.

21:30.950 --> 21:33.340
We don't need this thing.

21:34.010 --> 21:36.740
<i>Now, no one...</i>

21:37.180 --> 21:38.240
<i>No one...</i>

21:44.690 --> 21:45.940
Mr. Phoenix!

21:47.300 --> 21:48.440
Hang in there!

21:48.850 --> 21:50.580
I know you can fly!

21:55.750 --> 21:56.860
Yes!

21:59.080 --> 22:00.170
Wha?

22:04.750 --> 22:07.650
<i>I-Is she brain-dead?!</i>

22:07.650 --> 22:10.380
<i>Who jumps to save a bird that can't die?!</i>

22:10.380 --> 22:14.860
<i>You've gotta be the biggest idiot alive, you...</i>

22:14.860 --> 22:16.880
<i>halfwit numbskull!</i>

22:24.460 --> 22:28.160
M-Mr. Phoenix! You got your power back?!

22:28.160 --> 22:29.650
But how?

22:29.650 --> 22:35.090
Moron. Immortality and rebirth 
are mine to command.

22:35.470 --> 22:39.920
As long as you believe in me, 
I'll always come back.

22:42.110 --> 22:43.640
Wh-What's that?!

22:43.860 --> 22:45.500
I-It can't be!

22:48.220 --> 22:49.980
Mommy, a holy beast.

22:50.310 --> 22:55.110
Don't be silly. Holy beasts 
only appear at festivals.

22:55.110 --> 22:57.670
El! We've got a customer.

22:57.670 --> 22:59.150
O-Okay.

23:01.570 --> 23:06.450
Man, I haven't flown in ages. 
Even you're heavy for me, girlie.

23:06.730 --> 23:09.240
So get off, nincompoop!

23:09.240 --> 23:09.990
Huh?!

23:10.940 --> 23:16.000
<i>As long as someone believes in me,</i>

23:17.060 --> 23:18.870
<i>I can be strong...</i>

23:21.930 --> 23:24.210
<i>as many times as it takes.</i>

23:30.610 --> 23:34.340
I'll translate: "Bennu just 
loves the chancellor!"

23:34.340 --> 23:38.490
When did I say that, numbskull?! 
Don't put words in my mouth!

23:36.930 --> 23:39.930
Next Episode

23:36.930 --> 23:39.930
A Boy and the King of Beasts

23:38.490 --> 23:39.810
Of all the nerve...
